the Constitution. We would all do well to remember also t he 10th Amendment, which further clarifies the issue.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/3918239552262089567'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/3918239552262089567'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1411688120280#c3918239552262089567' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1916942809"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 25, 2014 at 5:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3627623269191881468</id><published>2014-03-01T22:41:26.926-07:00</published><updated>2014-03-01T22:41:26.926-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Somebody tell Raney when hammers go on sale at the...</title><content type='html'>Somebody tell Raney when hammers go on sale at the big box stores... two for the price of one... the best way to beat himself about the head.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/3627623269191881468'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/3627623269191881468'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1393738886926#c3627623269191881468' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1755294703"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2014 at 10:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7118503503015679784</id><published>2014-02-20T10:17:09.890-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-20T10:17:09.890-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Boise is a diseased town with progressive stooges,...</title><content type='html'>Boise is a diseased town with progressive stooges, like Raney, running the state. Idaho is NOT a &amp;quot;red state&amp;quot;. Meaning, it is not the place to move if one is looking to be more free from government intrusion. Sheriff Raney is a commie turd that needs to be flushed. When the SHTF, he will be one of the first to get it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/7118503503015679784'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/7118503503015679784'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1392916629890#c7118503503015679784' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1242989755"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2014 at 10:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8991524171146497972</id><published>2013-11-20T09:21:18.041-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-20T09:21:18.041-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr Grigg: FYI: This police abuse incident appeared...</title><content type='html'>Mr Grigg: FYI: This police abuse incident appeared in the San Francisco Chronicle this morning: http://www.sfgate.com/crime/article/200-march-in-Mission-District-condemning-police-4995157.php&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Best wishes -- and thank you for all your hard work.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mark</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/8991524171146497972'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/8991524171146497972'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384964478041#c8991524171146497972' title=''/><author><name>Socrates Wilde</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04859203417548988678</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-iz1w-adRM6I/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAOw/oVjpx4wEhIk/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-677118497"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 20, 2013 at 9:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-518230669862400537</id><published>2013-11-18T20:11:13.359-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-18T20:11:13.359-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Raney is a communist. We had a conversation when t...</title><content type='html'>Raney is a communist. We had a conversation when this first came out. All 44 sheriffs in Idaho did not say they would stand up to the Feds! This is false! They sad they support the Second Amendment. However, they said they would do as court (Supreme Court)ruled. So if the courts ruled that gun control was Constitutional, our sheriffs would back that up!!! My partner and I put on the Second Amendment rally in Idaho Falls. I was also a Constitutional sheriff candidate in Bonneville County. I am very well versed in this subject. Do you research and don&amp;#39;t believe things at face value! Most of our sheriffs play with words, but have never said they would stand up to the FEDS!!!! Sheriff Klinger of Madison County said he &amp;quot;MAY&amp;quot; do something if the Feds tried to confiscate firearms. If a man says he &amp;quot;may&amp;quot; or her &amp;quot;might&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;maybe&amp;quot; ...what do you think that means? It means he is weaseling his way out of making a real stand!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-Chad Christensen </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/518230669862400537'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/518230669862400537'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384830673359#c518230669862400537' title=''/><author><name>Chad Christensen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15743265938697649343</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-109547622"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 18, 2013 at 8:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5880239813403474786</id><published>2013-11-18T09:27:47.019-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-18T09:27:47.019-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Uh, Nullifier, it appears he does not.</title><content type='html'>Uh, Nullifier, it appears he does not.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5880239813403474786'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5880239813403474786'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384792067019#c5880239813403474786' title=''/><author><name>mark edward marchiafava</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08565098898973140013</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1392597843"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 18, 2013 at 9:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5295304671776240971</id><published>2013-11-15T12:12:42.988-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-15T12:12:42.988-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I wonder if the idiot Raney knows that the Suprema...</title><content type='html'>I wonder if the idiot Raney knows that the Supremacy Clause applies to enumerated powers only.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5295304671776240971'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5295304671776240971'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384542762988#c5295304671776240971' title=''/><author><name>Nullifier</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1433894648"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 15, 2013 at 12:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6495042313977010724</id><published>2013-11-14T21:38:10.512-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-14T21:38:10.512-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well you might like to know that like McConnell in...</title><content type='html'>Well you might like to know that like McConnell in this story, men and women in Ada and Canyon Counties have formed Constitution Militias.  All meetings are public and all are welcome.  You can find the units on Facebook as &amp;quot;Ada County 1st Battalion Light Foot Militia&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Canyon County 27th Battalion Light Foot Militia&amp;quot;. You can reach them respectively at IDCCG1A@cableone.net  and IDCCG2C@cableone.net.&lt;br /&gt;Sincerely,&lt;br /&gt;Capt Campbell, CO&lt;br /&gt;Ada County 1st BN</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/6495042313977010724'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/6495042313977010724'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384490290512#c6495042313977010724' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-712150789"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2013 at 9:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7899860454179249070</id><published>2013-11-14T10:40:36.042-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-14T10:40:36.042-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Yet another example of the anti-American communist...</title><content type='html'>Yet another example of the anti-American communists placed at the apex of the control hierarchy on every level. Everyone in this country are victims of a series of staged, wag-the-dog psyops designed to herd the citizenry into a deceptive and harmful reality.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/7899860454179249070'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/7899860454179249070'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384450836042#c7899860454179249070' title=''/><author><name>gmo2ashes</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1950762504"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2013 at 10:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1628933689619658212</id><published>2013-11-14T09:29:38.389-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-14T09:29:38.389-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I have no doubt whatsoever that these two sheriffs...</title><content type='html'>I have no doubt whatsoever that these two sheriffs are corrupt two-faced liars. I know for a fact that they are state paid federal employees and work with the feds to steal property from people for profit. Neither has any right to be in office in the State of Idaho as neither will EVER uphold the Idaho Constitution in any form. They have their own agendas and God help anyone who gets in their way. See: Sociopath.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/1628933689619658212'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/1628933689619658212'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384446578389#c1628933689619658212' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1157858158"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2013 at 9:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5779950427331999966</id><published>2013-11-14T08:56:20.415-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-14T08:56:20.415-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The Statesman only further erodes any good will I ...</title><content type='html'>The Statesman only further erodes any good will I harbored for that rag.   And it&amp;#39;s a reflection of a corrupt &amp;quot;head&amp;quot; that the Sherrif&amp;#39;s office and its &amp;quot;appendages&amp;quot; are equally corrupt.  Explains a lot to me.  So pathetic.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5779950427331999966'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8530545877312475913/comments/default/5779950427331999966'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html?showComment=1384444580415#c5779950427331999966' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/gary-raney-rogue-sheriff-federal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8530545877312475913' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8530545877312475913' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-739067299"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2013 at 8:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8008749983550760122</id><published>2013-11-13T23:54:33.325-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-13T23:54:33.325-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Couldn&amp;#39;t you get this article somehow into the...</title><content type='html'>Couldn&amp;#39;t you get this article somehow into the Idaho Statesman through any fairness rule or equal time allotment? Popkey is obviously a biased (and corrupt) individual and that makes the